Comment: 50,0:00:17.00,0:00:17.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Cold Open
Comment: 50,0:01:12.05,0:01:12.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,opsync,OP
Comment: 50,0:02:43.02,0:02:43.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part A
Comment: 50,0:12:34.02,0:12:34.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Part B
