Comment: 50,0:23:53.04,0:23:53.08,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,Preview
Dialogue: 50,0:00:19.25,0:00:20.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's do a training camp!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.29,Default,All,0,0,0,,A training camp?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:23.55,0:00:27.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It hit me after that quiz show the other day.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:27.88,0:00:31.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We don't have nearly enough teamwork!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:31.72,0:00:33.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hence, the training camp!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:34.81,0:00:37.06,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I don't want to go out in this heat.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.94,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is part of work too!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:38.94,0:00:42.65,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We'll train our singing and dancing\Nand learn more about each other!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:42.65,0:00:45.94,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,And we can top it off\Nby making a casual video!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:45.94,0:00:47.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We'll have a barbecue too!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.24,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm in! I wanna go!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:50.24,0:00:51.82,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I like your enthusiasm!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:51.82,0:00:53.28,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You too, Sena!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:53.28,0:00:54.58,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:54.58,0:00:55.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,What about you, Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:56.33,0:00:57.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Umm...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:59.75,0:01:03.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Let's go! I wanna talk to you more!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:05.55,0:01:07.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay, then!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:07.59,0:01:10.51,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That settles it! We're doing a training camp!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.51,0:01:12.05,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.94,0:02:53.24,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.20,0:02:59.70,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,How do I tell Mom and Dad\Nthat I'm staying over somewhere?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.95,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Good question...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.45,0:03:04.87,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I need an excuse...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.96,0:03:09.13,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Should I just tell them the truth?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.13,0:03:13.21,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,You can't! Your magic has to stay a secret!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.21,0:03:16.22,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Why not just tell them you're helping a friend?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.80,0:03:20.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Because I don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.81,0:03:26.02,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} your friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:29.86,0:03:33.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Uguisu, how do I give this to her?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.65,0:03:35.11,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,How about normally?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.78,0:03:38.82,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,How {\i1}is{\i0} "normally"? Tell me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:38.82,0:03:39.53,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.95,0:03:41.87,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,First, think of the training camp.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.87,0:03:44.50,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Right, the training camp!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.79,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I need an excuse...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.83,0:03:48.67,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.46,0:03:50.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Litto!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.26,0:03:59.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.72,0:04:02.97,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Make my training camp work out just fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.14,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.57,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.23,0:04:18.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Alright! Back to our strategy meeting\Non how to give big sis my present!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.91,0:04:22.62,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Huh?! No way, I'm sleepy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.41,0:04:27.83,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.83,0:04:28.92,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm set.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.92,0:04:30.04,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.75,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Oh, Fuu!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.75,0:04:33.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,G'morning...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.17,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Sorry this is sudden!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.01,0:04:39.18,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,Mom and I have to head out soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.18,0:04:40.05,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.01,0:04:45.97,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Our shop and Mari-chan's are taking part\Nin a market a bit far away from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Far away? Where is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.35,0:04:51.10,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Hm, where was it again?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.10,0:04:54.23,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,I think it was... west, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.23,0:04:55.23,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,West.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.86,0:05:01.78,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,I'm here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.78,0:05:05.20,Default,Mari,0,0,0,,Rui, Fuu, I'm borrowing your parents, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.20,0:05:06.99,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,We're on our way out!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.99,0:05:10.29,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,So yeah, it's west.\NWe'll be back the night after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh? The night after tomorrow?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.75,0:05:18.01,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Umm, I also have plans to go... out...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.01,0:05:19.92,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, you too, big sis?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.92,0:05:20.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.68,0:05:22.51,Default,Mom,0,0,0,,Don't forget to lock the doors!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.13,0:05:23.09,Default,Dad,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's west... right? West!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Magic is awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.14,0:05:28.35,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.89,0:05:33.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm all ready to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Fuu?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.04,0:05:53.42,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.54,0:05:57.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.00,0:06:00.59,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I saw these the other day\Nand thought they were cute,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.80,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,so I'm letting you have one!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.09,0:06:07.81,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It was a set of two.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.61,0:06:16.81,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I love the scent.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.19,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll put it to good use!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.65,0:06:20.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I gave it to her!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.12,0:06:32.04,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lililula, palilula!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.33,0:06:36.83,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Pam pam power!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.80,0:06:49.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm just as cute as ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.10,0:06:58.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We're adorable!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.78,0:07:06.03,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.03,0:07:07.49,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hey, over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.49,0:07:09.16,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.20,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You look happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.20,0:07:15.50,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You must be really excited for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.21,0:07:23.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Which one will you pick?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aww, again?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.43,0:07:30.68,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Your turn, Lulu.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.14,0:07:32.10,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Lulu-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.10,0:07:32.93,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.14,0:07:38.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.52,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'm out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.52,0:07:42.53,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.53,0:07:43.48,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.57,0:07:46.36,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm all out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.49,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,You're too reactive.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.91,0:07:50.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This'll be it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.78,0:07:52.83,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Hold on, now.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.29,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,You're always hanging around us, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.42,0:08:02.13,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,But you do know we're on a train, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.46,0:08:03.88,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Uh, you want some?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.21,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Really...?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.18,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,It's the sea!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.81,0:08:21.19,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's better than I expected!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.19,0:08:23.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,This cottage... is very big!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.32,0:08:25.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This place is so spacious!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.65,0:08:27.07,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's pretty on the inside too.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.07,0:08:29.03,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go explore!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.08,0:08:42.33,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,This will make a good game\Nof hide and seek!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.30,0:08:51.51,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This'll do.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.93,0:08:53.97,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We can use this for practice.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.72,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.18,0:08:59.64,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,I can't believe you were able\Nto rent a fancy place like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.27,0:09:02.90,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What is it...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.90,0:09:06.78,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You won't believe it. It was super cheap!\NAin't that right, Prez?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.19,0:09:11.78,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,It has a private beach, and it's less than half\Nthe price of the surrounding properties.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.11,0:09:18.16,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,It sounds like it went up for sale at first,\Nbut no one bought it, so they started renting it out instead.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.16,0:09:19.79,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Certainly a bargain for us.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.66,0:09:24.13,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I'm lodging somewhere else,\Nso you girls take care of this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.63,0:09:27.00,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Don't cause any trouble for your neighbors.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.96,Default,All,0,0,0,,We won't!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.34,0:09:30.97,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.72,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Not like they have any neighbors.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.10,0:09:39.43,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,So, um... how do we start our training camp?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,We go on an adventure, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.52,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we decide on our rooms?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That can wait. First order of business...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.23,0:09:48.53,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We swim!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.53,0:09:52.07,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Why do we have swimsuits?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.07,0:09:54.20,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She said she brought them\Nfrom the agency.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.24,0:09:57.28,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Can we really go swim?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.28,0:10:01.37,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,S-She's right! We're here to practice.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.37,0:10:04.83,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Seriously? Summer means sea,\Nand we've got our own private beach!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It's only the natural thing to do!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.96,0:10:08.88,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's swim.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.88,0:10:09.76,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.84,0:10:13.13,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Slow down!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.93,0:10:15.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You too, Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.18,0:10:16.68,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.46,0:10:49.71,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,The agency's gotten a lot livelier lately.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.71,0:10:52.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,To think it was just us two originally.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.34,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Well, the president was there too.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.34,0:10:55.97,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.97,0:10:59.10,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But still, we're pretty lucky\Nthose girls joined us.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.89,0:11:02.89,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Do you think we're on track...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.43,0:11:06.15,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,to dominate showbiz?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.15,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.78,0:11:17.11,Default,Azuki,0,0,0,,Steady, steady...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.37,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Next, lip rolls.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.87,0:11:26.37,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Again, but like you're sighing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Next, humming.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.97,0:11:35.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.48,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Look at her go.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.48,0:11:53.73,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,How can she dance so well\Nafter all that playing?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.32,0:11:55.69,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It's because she's serious.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.40,0:12:01.28,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,In Toko's eyes, the most important part\Nto being an idol is giving your all in everything.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.54,0:12:06.21,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Toko-san is amazing.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.50,0:12:14.00,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lulu and Lilly, your task for today\Nis to memorize the dance I just did.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.17,0:12:17.05,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,W-Will we be able to?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.05,0:12:20.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You have to! Sena, any advice for them?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.30,0:12:23.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Do it 300 times and you'll have it memorized.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.35,0:12:24.52,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Three {\i1}hundred?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.93,0:12:27.39,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,And no dinner until you've got it down!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.02,0:12:30.60,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Being an idol is tough work!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.60,0:12:33.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,L-Let's do our best, Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.03,0:12:40.20,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Can you bring this to the others?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.20,0:12:40.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.83,0:12:51.58,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.25,0:12:53.84,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.17,0:12:56.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't move...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.51,0:13:00.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Keep doing it and you'll get the hang of it.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.30,0:13:02.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, Kabappy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.01,0:13:04.68,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Let's take a break.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.68,0:13:05.56,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.94,0:13:14.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, right. How long have you and Toko-san been idols?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.94,0:13:18.65,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Since spring last year.\NToko brought it up out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.15,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.57,0:13:24.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,We went through a lot,\Nbut none of it worked out.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.33,0:13:25.91,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Until you two came along.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.33,0:13:26.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.58,0:13:32.42,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Toko's gone on about it, like,\N"now that they're here, I might achieve my dream."
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.42,0:13:33.38,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Her dream?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.92,0:13:34.79,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.79,0:13:38.59,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She wants to succeed as an idol\Nand shock everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.59,0:13:40.17,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,That's her dream.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:41.26,0:13:44.05,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,And she made a whole company\Njust to make it come true.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:44.05,0:13:46.35,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,She's always been bold like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.68,0:13:49.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Are you like, super close?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.60,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,We're just normal friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.60,0:13:54.06,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Show me some old pictures!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.06,0:13:55.77,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,No way. It's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I brought drinks.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.69,0:13:59.99,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.36,0:13:56.77,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}C'mon, show me!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.03,0:13:59.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wanna see!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.36,0:14:04.49,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Also, I want to see those pictures too...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.99,0:14:06.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.66,0:14:09.54,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.54,0:14:11.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Someone sounds perky.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.38,0:14:16.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Alright, break time's over!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.46,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Let's go over that last part!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.76,0:14:29.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,It should be live now... I think?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.18,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What do we talk about on the livestream?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.18,0:14:33.85,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I'm so nervous!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.85,0:14:35.81,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, we have some viewers!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.81,0:14:38.65,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good evening! We're Production Once More!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.65,0:14:41.24,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This is our first video!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.24,0:14:42.82,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Everyone, say hello!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.82,0:14:44.45,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm Sena.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.20,Default,Lilly,0,0,0,,Good evening, I'm Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.70,Default,Lulu,0,0,0,,I'm L-Lu-Lulu!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,"Lululu"...?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,You're trying too hard.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.29,0:14:55.04,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.42,0:14:57.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,And finally, I'm Toko!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.38,0:14:59.71,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh! We have a comment!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.71,0:15:01.17,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"Where are you?"
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.17,0:15:03.38,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're at a cottage doing\Na training camp!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.38,0:15:04.72,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.72,0:15:06.68,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.68,0:15:08.60,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.22,0:15:13.77,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,So, um, do we have any topics?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.77,0:15:15.94,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Topics, topics...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.40,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Do you have one, Lulu-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.40,0:15:20.02,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,A topic?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.57,0:15:27.41,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.41,0:15:28.37,Alt,Fuu,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.37,0:15:29.32,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.99,0:15:33.33,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,We all talked so much\Nbefore we started recording...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.42,0:15:37.29,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.83,0:15:41.04,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Oh, we're getting a lot of new viewers!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.63,0:15:43.01,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.88,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Another comment!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.88,0:15:47.13,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"I saw the Hell's Quiz!"...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.89,0:15:51.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wow, looks like a lot of people tuned into that!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.14,0:15:53.14,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"I'm such a big fan!"
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.52,0:15:54.93,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.94,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.60,0:16:02.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,If we get more fans like we planned,\Nthen we've got this.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.32,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I love you, Lilly-chan!"
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.74,0:16:07.28,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Look! One of them says they love Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.28,0:16:08.91,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.91,0:16:10.87,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I'm your fan, Lilly-chan!"
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.87,0:16:12.99,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Whoa, we're getting a lot!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.99,0:16:16.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,That's great! If anyone has questions,\Nsend them our way!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.50,0:16:19.71,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Lilly-chan's so cute when she's flustered, wah!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.71,0:16:20.75,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Who's your oshi?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.25,0:16:20.75,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait, slow down!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.75,0:16:21.67,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Mine is Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.67,0:16:22.92,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}What idol is your god?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.92,0:16:23.96,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Mine is Lilly-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.63,Default,Idol Fan,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Lilly-chan, what do you do\Non your days off??
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.92,0:16:25.55,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't keep up with this!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.88,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Wait! Slow down a little please!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.68,0:16:30.64,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.68,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,"You're all amazing!"
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.27,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Oh, more comments! Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.35,0:16:42.65,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,That was a lot, but it was so fun!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.65,0:16:47.03,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We hit 3,000 viewers.\NWe just can't keep up with that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.03,0:16:48.45,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It took me by surprise.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.86,0:16:52.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We didn't get nearly as much of a reception\Nwhen it was just the two of us.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.74,0:16:56.12,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,So I guess I have you two to thank for that.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.12,0:16:57.45,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please, you don't!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.45,0:16:59.83,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I mean it, seriously!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.83,0:17:03.13,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Thank you for joining our agency.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.30,0:17:08.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,But you won't get the best of me!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.47,0:17:12.14,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We'll whip you into shape again tomorrow!\NBut for now, we sleep!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.14,0:17:13.30,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Whip us into shape?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.30,0:17:15.51,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Oh boy, she's all pumped up.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.97,0:17:18.35,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Please be gentle on us.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.62,0:17:37.49,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Gotta pee...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.30,0:17:56.60,Default,Uguisu,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have gone alone...?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.60,0:17:59.43,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,I can't help it, it's scary...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.53,0:18:10.44,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where are you from?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.33,0:18:21.96,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.00,0:18:26.29,Default,Fuu,0,0,0,,Wait up! Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.24,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.91,0:19:01.16,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Did she go to Uguisu?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.29,0:19:06.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.00,0:19:07.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Good morning! Did you sleep good?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.96,0:19:08.75,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.63,0:19:13.01,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.01,0:19:14.88,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,All that's left is Lilly.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.88,0:19:19.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I sorta figured she wasn't a morning gal.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.85,0:19:20.89,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Same.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.89,0:19:23.10,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,I'll go wake her.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.69,0:19:30.36,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Lilly-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.41,0:19:37.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.99,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.25,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,She's gone...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.04,0:19:45.58,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Azuki and Uguisu too...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.58,0:19:46.79,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,She's gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.79,0:19:52.42,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Yes. I checked the other rooms too,\Nbut couldn't find her anywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.93,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly! Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:57.93,0:19:58.64,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.64,0:20:01.93,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Did she go outside?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.93,0:20:03.18,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Maybe to the beach?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.89,0:20:07.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.81,0:20:09.06,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Toko-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.77,0:20:14.32,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,The door won't open, but it's not locked...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.32,0:20:16.45,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Huh? I think you're just half-asleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.82,0:20:19.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'm serious! Try it yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.16,0:20:23.41,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,It won't budge.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.87,0:20:25.95,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We could try the other exits.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.71,0:20:29.96,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,This won't budge either.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.79,0:20:32.00,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,Even the windows are stuck?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.00,0:20:33.46,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Dang it.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.38,0:20:36.09,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.76,0:20:38.55,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,T-Toko-san...
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.47,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I'll call Prez.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.10,0:20:46.06,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.06,0:20:48.60,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Prez, it's an emergency.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.85,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Lilly's gone missing.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.85,0:20:53.23,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Are you sure she's not just on a walk?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.44,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,She can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.44,0:20:58.74,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,We're stuck inside too.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.74,0:21:01.62,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,I can't... you... You there?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.62,0:21:02.87,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.87,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Hey, turn off the TV.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.83,0:21:07.87,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.25,0:21:13.21,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Laughing...?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.21,0:21:16.38,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Look, I can't hear you over\Nall that weird noise.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.80,0:21:19.59,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? The TV's not on.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.18,0:21:23.76,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Anyways, we need you to—
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.76,0:21:26.68,Default,Yasuo,0,0,0,,Huh? Uh, um... Toko?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.68,0:21:29.43,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,Prez? Prez?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.44,0:21:33.94,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.69,0:21:39.82,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,I lost signal.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.99,0:21:41.82,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.66,0:21:44.57,Default,Sena,0,0,0,,Lilly?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.97,0:22:01.30,Default,Toko,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.36,0:22:22.49,Default,Rui,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Comment: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.43,Signs,,0,0,0,,Training Camp
